' blDoc - common base for open documents.
' The blSheet tab bar lists open files: they can be text documents (blDocument, in blTextboxes)
' or drawings (blDataDraw, in blDrawboxes).
' This is the part that tabs must know in both cases, so
' an application can keep texts and drawings open together.

Import blWins


Class blDoc

	Field fullname:String
	Field projname:String
	Field sclist:blShortcutList

End
